        "source_locator": "Guideline VOR PDF p3/journal p230, Table 1B; pp7-10/journal pp234-237, Recommendations 3-5",
        "direct_source_fact": "Guideline Table 1B and Recommendations 3-5 specify persistence checks, surveillance through 5 years, and most-suspicious-nodule routing for solitary and multiple subsolid nodules.",
